	(text "AT42QT1070 (Atmel 9596C-AT42-05/2013): key outline 6 x 6 mm or larger (panel thickness dependent); plastic panels up to 5 mm;\n  Cx 1-30 pF per key; MODE = GND selects comms mode (rev A root cause); no pull-ups here (host 1.8 k on the Pi).\nElectrodes 16 x 16 mm (rev C: Ø12): QTAN0062 2.3 - electrode dimension >= 4 x panel thickness; panel = 2.5 wall + 0.7 cloth\n  = 3.2 mm (rev F model, not measured) -> >= 12.8 mm. Centres unchanged from rev F: front-view X 9/33/57/81, Y 13.\nBoard 90 x 44 x 1.6 (rev F seat), no holes except tented vias; front = electrodes only; all parts and the HOST pads on the back.\nBME680 / VEML6030 leads now land on the main board (J10); VL53L0X cluster dropped."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 160.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
